WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.590
In Bihar, in India, one tree
draws pilgrims from Sri Lanka,

2
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.530
Thailand, Myanmar and Tibet.

3
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.900
Some Tibetan pilgrims make full-length
prostrations along the way.

4
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.790
At the end, they walk clockwise
round a tall temple tower,

5
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.030
then sit beneath the tree.

6
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.980
Why would anyone travel thousands
of miles just to sit under a tree?

7
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:27.280
In this mission, you'll map the 4 places
the Buddha named as worth seeing with

8
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.430
reverence.

9
00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:33.370
Then you'll find out what pilgrims do at
the place where the Buddha first taught.

10
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.140
Your mission: find out why Buddhists
travel thousands of miles to sit under a

11
00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:38.840
tree.
